{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28495","headline":"帘 · 杜牧","name":"帘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"徒云逢剪削，岂谓见偏装。\n凤节轻雕日，鸾花薄餙香。\n问屏何屈曲，怜帐解周防。\n下渍金阶露，斜分碧瓦霜。\n沈沈伴春梦，寂寂侍华堂。\n谁见昭阳殿，真珠十二行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}